[{"title":"喜闻瑩中同预归田之数","author":"邹浩","text":"简在天心世所知，赐环欣与我同归。\n耦耕曩已神先受，追路今休咏式微。\n洗脚上船无昨梦，举头见日有祥辉。\n扶摇本自南溟起，只恐难淹九万飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57174,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"栩栩轩","author":"邹浩","text":"不知觉梦不知忧，物与心冥事事休。\n此是道人真境界，西家分得亦同游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57175,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦曾存之见过 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"疋马来过笑且言，廉州象郡亦同还。\n今朝敕了明朝下，尽是君王独断间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57176,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦曾存之见过 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"衡阳深赖帝怜之，论者虽多不远移。\n一日一书谁管得，人生倾倒在相知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57177,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻归田之命怀同废诸公","author":"邹浩","text":"同时废逐十馀人，我是丹书第一名。\n方向岭边思往咎，忽蒙天上许归耕。\n诸公想亦茅连茹，此日宜皆水濯缨。\n覆载恩深力图报，从今尤在罄精诚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57178,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池上","author":"邹浩","text":"荷花荷叶满池塘，柄柄摇风作晚凉。\n忽忆新开湖里过，绕船终日送清香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57179,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题天绘亭","author":"邹浩","text":"杖屦追随陟杳冥，无边胜景集孤亭。\n解衣自若谁为史，造物难穷巧赋形。\n展拓二仪成缟素，均调一气作丹青。\n会将断取山川手，卷入中州挂户庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57180,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山鹕","author":"邹浩","text":"大如青菜小如乌，色亦苍然二者俱。\n嗣岁不惟催布谷，可人尤是劝提壶。\n巧兼琴弄端谁使，追得年光赖尔呼。\n萱草堂高欣属耳，筠笼随我入东吴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57181,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遣感","author":"邹浩","text":"我命还须我自推，细微休更问蓍龟。\n枯茎朽骨犹能兆，岂有灵台不了知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57182,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鷾鸸","author":"邹浩","text":"畏人常是袭人间，人不能伤自往还。\n争似鸾凰在寥廓，更无尘虑杳难攀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57183,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观赦文","author":"邹浩","text":"吾皇恭己奉三无，大赦敷天孰向隅。\n自顾归田夙遭遇，与人同庆倍欢呼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57184,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别元老","author":"邹浩","text":"不因投窜抵昭平，争得相逢一笑亲。\n尘里妙空居士室，琴边聊见宰官身。\n周颙尚以妻为累，元亮惟知隐是真。\n莫逆于心更何语，拨开船子过牢津。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57185,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书","author":"邹浩","text":"去年端午尚京居，骨肉团栾奉板舆。\n今日菖蒲还荐酒，犹于岭表待文书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57186,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重午王文辅送米食张云卿送新酒来因成绝句","author":"邹浩","text":"水团粽子恰登门，白酒持来更满樽。\n节物人情总堪醉，况归田里已承恩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57187,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竞渡","author":"邹浩","text":"坊村一处一龙船，擘浪飞桡斗欲先。\n要识晚来谁胜捷，但听歌吹鼓声喧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57188,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄俞清老","author":"邹浩","text":"卧龙前约竟悠悠，依旧淮南笑不休。\n落发出家成往事，从僧还俗惬新谋。\n未尝异也谁燕越，相与呼之任马牛。\n一滴曹溪好消息，为君船子下扬州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57189,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦立求轩名以其面莲池十许顷名之曰妙喜轩","author":"邹浩","text":"莲华千叶满前开，断取应从妙喜来。\n色带日光飞缥缈，香乘风力转徘徊。\n休寻物外庵罗果，且进池边鹦鹉杯。\n一笑真能契无染，不妨游戏挟霆雷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57190,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书","author":"邹浩","text":"白昼谈禅木上座，清宵同梦竹夫人。\n此心莫逆仙宫下，一片乾坤特地新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57191,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王道人云彦和得报有归田之命","author":"邹浩","text":"道人新自象州来，殿院从容得屡陪。\n坐上拆书归有日，愁容忽作笑颜开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57192,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉者","author":"邹浩","text":"至化无私被远方，渔樵谁不似颠狂。\n得钱沽酒争酬酢，执手高歌入醉乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57193,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"商丘","author":"邹浩","text":"视人所不窥，修人所不为。\n奉以无愧怍，商丘是吾师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57194,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"勉祖道修子美祠堂","author":"邹浩","text":"工部云亡几百年，精诚如在有遗编。\n笔追六义回千古，名薄三光亘九天。\n师法周流寰海内，祠堂落寞楚江边。\n长官风化尊贤急，想见丹青复焕然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57195,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"追思去岁今日出京有作","author":"邹浩","text":"解船东下出都门，倏已弥年讵可论。\n圣主只应怜旧物，归欤朝夕被深恩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57196,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读易","author":"邹浩","text":"时时飞雨作清凉，六月南方似北方。\n阁上独居无一事，韦编聊复到羲皇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57197,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书","author":"邹浩","text":"白发倚门无限情，江湖渺渺秋欲生。\n回船捩柁见归路，天道无私怜汝诚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57198,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王氏阁旧名拾青郡守王藻以余寓居易名来仙","author":"邹浩","text":"仙宫岭下来仙阁，太守更名为我来。\n来既有时归有日，泠然从此御风回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57199,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"形影相随甫半年，皇恩今日放归田。\n回头一梦惊初觉，敢把穷通更问天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57200,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"阻奉晨昏宁孝子，窜投荒远岂忠臣。\n今朝恩放归田去，留得遗踪警后人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57201,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜书","author":"邹浩","text":"水北摘禾将欲了，水南发瘴已皆安。\n憣然回指潇湘去，感激天恩分外宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57202,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"记梦","author":"邹浩","text":"卜筮俱言七月嘉，夜来魂梦更高华。\n此生岂复公卿望，惟喜斑衣早到家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57203,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻仲殊长老化去甚异","author":"邹浩","text":"逆行天莫测，雉作渎中经。\n沤灭风前质，莲开火后形。\n钵盂残蜜白，炉灶冷烟清。\n空有谁家曲，人间得细听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57204,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"邹浩","text":"去年今日别庭闱，回首庭闱未得归。\n天道人心会相契，归欤行即被恩辉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57205,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"追怀去年今日舟离润州有作","author":"邹浩","text":"帆出丹阳恰一年，江湖陈迹慨茫然。\n明明归路留双目，只候恩书下九天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57206,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自叹","author":"邹浩","text":"好学颜渊怒不迁，犯而不校古称贤。\n伊予物触心犹动，空抚陈编倍赧然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57207,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"主人忽来夹径修篱","author":"邹浩","text":"疏篱诘曲巧依山，洞彻柴门气象还。\n恩释羁留应有日，故先通路指乡关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57208,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大风累日不止","author":"邹浩","text":"昭平八月稻禾风，吹尽浮云露碧空。\n日月从今无障碍，光明照我入天中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57209,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日","author":"邹浩","text":"归田日日望恩光，今日尤思返故乡。\n淡饭三杯菊花酒，何妨随俗且重阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57210,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送择老赴桂州龙华会","author":"邹浩","text":"罪大投身瘴疠乡，亲年老矣重难忘。\n龙华会上俱贤圣，为爇精诚一炷香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57211,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观牡丹","author":"邹浩","text":"去年寒食已为客，今年寒食未还家。\n春前莫负一杯酒，山后聊观三朵花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57212,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送希古","author":"邹浩","text":"清都不敢梦中游，何况通明侍冕旒。\n分手知从天上去，望云深感岭边留。\n三年瘴疠精神在，一日功名謦欬收。\n骥足风生谁绊得，绿杨芳草谩高楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57213,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"揽秀轩","author":"邹浩","text":"观书已若观山水，今更开轩山水来。\n岌岌云收腾日月，滔滔鱼跃起风雷。\n二仪歘向胸中集，万象都从笔下回。\n只恐高深亦欣览，秀才尤秀出尘埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57214,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"简君瑞觅竹叶清","author":"邹浩","text":"通道三杯如李白，解酲五斗似刘伶。\n尔来心渴鸭头绿，应许唇沾竹叶青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57215,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"君瑞酒来用前韵","author":"邹浩","text":"蟾影舞花真窈窕，江风吹竹是伦伶。\n开壶日月欣浮白，放眼乾坤得倍青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57216,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻正夫迁门下","author":"邹浩","text":"促膝论心十二年，有时忠愤泪潸然。\n不闻一事拳拳救，但见三台每每迁。\n天地岂容将计免，国家能报乃身全。\n它时会有相逢日，解说何由复自贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57217,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"开窗","author":"邹浩","text":"雨师风伯倏回车，今日春工得自如。\n窗牖洞开除障碍，尽教风景到吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57218,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"对牡丹","author":"邹浩","text":"轻云笼日雨收尘，天作奇花照眼明。\n莫道岭边无好况，吾今春在洛阳城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57219,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻鹧鸪","author":"邹浩","text":"默默炎荒已岁馀，音书那复阻三吴。\n晚来何限青天出，独倚栏杆闻鹧鸪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57220,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观插田","author":"邹浩","text":"几片空田白水中，朝来俄已绿茸茸。\n自怜于此留居久，两见插禾勤老农。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57221,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佛前笋 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"基构于今政十年，不容山竹暗行鞭。\n森然五笋自何出，盛矣文邦相与传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57222,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佛前笋 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"和气潜通无间断，佛光回照有因缘。\n恩书不远归期近，已觉斑衣色倍鲜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57223,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"写黄庭 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"来仙阁上道生成，芝满丹田郁郁青。\n不为换鹅为物役，焚香閒自写黄庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57224,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"写黄庭 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"黄庭窈窈在吾身，洒扫尘氛集万神。\n但自精诚如一日，莫愁金阙不高真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57225,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"写黄庭 其三","author":"邹浩","text":"高真元是世间人，能密枢机到上清。\n天地有终吾不老，环刚犹得度群生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57226,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"写黄庭 其四","author":"邹浩","text":"群生何事日营营，浪以三元作五兵。\n未及残人先自贼，几时重得见升平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57227,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"写黄庭 其五","author":"邹浩","text":"升平无象亦无名，翼翼巍巍拱玉宸。\n流泽自周人自乐，普天同入万年春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57228,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"榕树","author":"邹浩","text":"榕树能容故得名，枝条环布若高城。\n何当种满弥天去，永使青青芘万生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57229,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄阳行先","author":"邹浩","text":"曾以高风入冕旒，未闻释耒起南州。\n当缘我罪投荒远，亦使君身得滞留。\n万卷功名閒处立，一瓢境界静中收。\n它年太史无虚美，卓行还能与祖侔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57230,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻王吕二公罢郡皆得宫观","author":"邹浩","text":"庚子同灾知几人，二公华显独超伦。\n比闻贬责祠宫去，始信推移运数均。\n势冷有官犹是贵，居閒无禄未为贫。\n须知削籍投荒者，惟望归欤作幸民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57231,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以常宁铅炉合供政首座因用旧韵发一笑","author":"邹浩","text":"十年流落见无由，谁识江东有赵州。\n凭仗炉烟寄消息，定中应亦展眉头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57232,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻政公住庵将成辄以只么名之并寄绝句","author":"邹浩","text":"纵横参了祖师禅，聊唱还乡信此缘。\n粥饭年来一齐足，不妨和束带刀眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57233,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"招政首座","author":"邹浩","text":"高歌一曲破还乡，只么随缘是道场。\n已向承天设双榻，待师同快竹风凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57234,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感","author":"邹浩","text":"真诀由来甚易明，惟人用志不精诚。\n从今谨事先生语，何患无阶朝玉清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57235,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪梦","author":"邹浩","text":"梦如符节自然合，吉事有开期必先。\n天地无私人主圣，孤臣从此望归田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57236,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"母氏诞生之日得家书喜不自胜形于鄙句","author":"邹浩","text":"萱草留春瑞气长，二年吴越杳相望。\n炉烟正起依南极，乡信俄来自北堂。\n委曲备闻逾获宝，欢欣遥想盛称觞。\n人心天意端如此，行矣归宁慰寿康。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57237,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读林醇中书","author":"邹浩","text":"天下苍生如我何，故人犹祝保天和。\n奉亲志意得归路，报国功名还钓蓑。\n已分息心随饮啄，不应平地起风波。\n璚瑶欲报安能报，空向秦淮怅望多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57238,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读钱济明书","author":"邹浩","text":"无书可借即捐书，日月云烟见未除。\n言与不言俱是着，损之又损亦非如。\n琴边酩酊何关酒，濠上从容岂在鱼。\n为报冰华老居士，吾今无欠亦无馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57239,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读袁柬之书","author":"邹浩","text":"人生游艺亦多端，莫若医书可纵观。\n曾向千金深有得，孰云三界果无安。\n忘怀已自袪灾瘴，寄语尤知笃岁寒。\n敢不拜嘉勤辅助，保全归去奉亲欢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57240,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读从外祖书","author":"邹浩","text":"善如平路恶如巇，底事前人浪自疑。\n方寸但令无愧怍，彼苍何虑有偏私。\n流言耸动知公旦，削迹奇穷见仲尼。\n事事存心惟节慎，大哉斯语是吾师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57241,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪梦","author":"邹浩","text":"玉色照清都，孤臣亦侍书。\n叨蒙一笔赐，恩似五年初。\n窜逐虽云远，精诚自不疏。\n皇心定垂恻，行获奉安舆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57242,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客惠团茶","author":"邹浩","text":"久矣去清班，无因预匪颁。\n殊方得高义，使我失愁颜。\n月满浮云散，龙飞瑞气还。\n炎氛自辟易，归路见乡关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57243,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"移夹竹桃","author":"邹浩","text":"将谓轻红间老青，元来一本自然成。\n叶如桃叶回环布，枝似竹枝罗列生。\n兰助珍羞香不断，萱留喜意色方明。\n更移此本家园去，岁岁花时献寿觥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57244,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻茉莉香 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"日收炎照沈沈去，月放凉光冉冉回。\n茉莉一如知我意，并从轩外送香来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57245,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻茉莉香 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"青琅玕里白玫瑰，不受尘氛天自开。\n最好夜凉初雨过，清香习习向人来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57246,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒步","author":"邹浩","text":"不出柴门半月强，偶随鸥鹭到池塘。\n荷花莲叶薰风里，一似去年无限香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57247,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鉴华亭","author":"邹浩","text":"群芳移自岭南州，要使儿童慎厥修。\n看取逐时花烂熳，即知当日罪拘留。\n黄茅瘴里诚难脱，紫极光中偶见收。\n汝辈但将吾作鉴，勿愁忠孝不优游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57248,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]